      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1774877042,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key differences vs Balanced MoE:",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key differences vs Balanced MoE:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XH2nD6nTHmQDQ_qgFwtAl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2551,
      "width": 823.1999999999999,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 790759293,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1649291561,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Routing scope:  softmax over ALL E experts first, then topK → renormalize  (balanced: same gate)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Routing scope:  softmax over ALL E experts first, then topK → renormalize  (balanced: same gate)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7CqNjvR5TNd12ciKhsAsi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2573,
      "width": 974.4,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2073367362,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 476082086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Dispatch:  one_hot [S,K,E] + permute + torch.where per expert  (vs sort-by-expert + coalesced scatter_pack kernel)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Dispatch:  one_hot [S,K,E] + permute + torch.where per expert  (vs sort-by-expert + coalesced scatter_pack kernel)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7HhakT5vfmCrHfc-DBQGc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2595,
      "width": 957.5999999999999,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 102658040,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 57326992,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• GEMM pattern:  8 separate small GEMMs [n,M]×[M,2EI] — serial, no batching  (vs 2 batched bmm [E,CAP,M]×[E,M,EI])",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• GEMM pattern:  8 separate small GEMMs [n,M]×[M,2EI] — serial, no batching  (vs 2 batched bmm [E,CAP,M]×[E,M,EI])",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MVYv3l7iyt5DDB5dPXeUZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2617,
      "width": 1016.4,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1352844206,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 676678985,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Token count:  variable n per expert — no capacity buffer, no padding  (balanced: fixed CAP = S×K/E with 1.25× overflow)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Token count:  variable n per expert — no capacity buffer, no padding  (balanced: fixed CAP = S×K/E with 1.25× overflow)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Z9V_lbSvK1iY0ne_1N1Ev",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2639,
      "width": 697.1999999999999,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1721501665,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 200735024,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• index_add_ per expert  (balanced: scatter_combine kernel with pre-sorted indices)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• index_add_ per expert  (balanced: scatter_combine kernel with pre-sorted indices)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R1iTvQrrixyW_PtT7w4v6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 2661,
      "width": 714,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1550799163,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 824060811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Wall-time:  higher overhead per FLOP — torch.where + control flow + no bmm batching",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Wall-time:  higher overhead per FLOP — torch.where + control flow + no bmm batching",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A0hEKECN7A9lwa8orKtdk",
